SSPI-rs authentication library

Project: https://github.com/Devolutions/sspi-rs
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0

Greenmole RDP uses SSPI-rs through IronRDP and as an explicitly versioned
server-authentication dependency. The accompanying license texts are copied
from the upstream project. The library retains its original authorship and
copyright; its inclusion does not imply upstream endorsement.

The vendored runtime includes local account-selection, NTLMv2 proof/MIC
validation and diagnostic changes. Source provenance and modifications are
documented in crates/sspi-patched/UPSTREAM.md and PATCHES.md in the source tree.
